        "content": "## FOM roll-to-roll coater: Generic dashboard\n\nThis dashboard plots measurement channels represented by semantic properties that can be used across compatible coating and drying equipment. Signals are grouped according to their semantic property and physical unit.\n\n\nThis dashboard plots **16 channel(s)** grouped under **4 semantic property/properties**.\n\nEach time-series panel represents one semantic property. Signals that use the same semantic property and physical unit are displayed together so that related equipment values can be compared.\n\nThe data is read from the equipment time-series tables. Each table contains a `time` column and a `value` column.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
